dstargateway (0.7-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the reflector host files the way "make newhostfiles" fetches them:
    DExtra_Hosts.txt, DCS_Hosts.txt and DPlus_Hosts.txt are downloaded from
    Pi-Star at build time, with the copies from Data/ as an offline fallback.
  * Add dstargateway-update-hostfiles, dstargateway-hostfiles.service and
    dstargateway-hostfiles.timer to refresh the host files daily on the
    installed system.
  * The postinst triggers one host file update and enables the timer.

 -- Geoffrey Merck <F4FXL@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:10:00 +0200

dstargateway (0.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Local build of upstream DStarGateway 0.7 (git 0c1dbb5).
  * Files are installed in /usr/bin, /etc/dstargateway, /usr/share/dstargateway
    and /var/log/dstargateway instead of the upstream /usr/local tree.
  * systemd units dstargateway.service and dgwtimeserver.service are enabled,
    but not started, so the configuration can be edited first.

 -- Geoffrey Merck <F4FXL@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:01:52 +0200
